{"agent_id":"pp3g-sQsC-recovery-issue-406-five-mimo-auditor-agents-completed","agent_seq":6,"timestamp":"2026-08-18T08:06:17.201595435Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"423a26ad-8367-4629-9bd7-18744aacd9b5","comment_uuid":"883d1ba0-72ee-4a47-a5a6-df24a4473955","author":"pp3g-sQsC-recovery-issue-406-five-mimo-auditor-agents-completed","content":"## AUDIT VERDICT: CONDITIONAL PASS (reconstructed from agent pane — agent pp3g-Jo2n was unable to post due to sandbox restrictions)\n\n**Agent:** pp3g-Jo2n\n**Audit scope:** Verify the hook-inventory deliverable (#391) — hookability classifications per playbook section, mechanism assignments, 'already hook-enforced' claims, and priority ranking.\n\n### Verification Performed (from tmux pane)\n\nThe agent read and independently verified the following files against the inventory's claims:\n\n| File | What was verified |\n|------|-------------------|\n| .crosslink/hook-config.json | Config structure, agent_overrides.by_type, allowed_bash_prefixes |\n| .opencode/permissions.md | Permission model for four roles |\n| .opencode/opencode.json | Plugin array: orchestrator-guard, crosslink-guard, rtk-guard |\n| .opencode/plugins/crosslink-guard.ts | tool.execute.before intercept, throw blocking, blocked/gated git commands, comment discipline, active-issue enforcement |\n| .opencode/plugins/orchestrator-guard.ts | tool.execute.before write blocking by agent type (edit:deny for non-Builder) |\n| .opencode/plugins/rtk-guard.ts | tool.execute.before command mutation, V1_VALIDATED allowlist |\n| tools/kickoff-notify.py | Agent lifecycle watcher (Phase 1) — systemd timer, LAUNCHING→RUNNING→DONE state machine |\n| .claude/hooks/heartbeat.py | Agent heartbeats on 120s throttle |\n\n### Findings\n\nThe agent successfully located and read all plugin and hook infrastructure files. The inventory's 'already hook-enforced' claims are consistent with the actual code:\n\n- **crosslink-guard.ts**: Confirmed blocks git push/merge for workers, gates commit on active issue, enforces comment discipline, kill/pause flags\n- **orchestrator-guard.ts**: Confirmed blocks write/edit/apply_patch for non-Builder agents\n- **rtk-guard.ts**: Confirmed transparent RTK command rewriting\n- **heartbeat.py + kickoff-notify.py**: Confirmed lifecycle monitoring infrastructure exists\n\n### Preconditions for Full PASS\n\n1. The agent was unable to verify git branch awareness (rtk git branch blocked by sandbox) — low risk, not relevant to hookability claims\n2. The inventory's 'not hookable' classifications require semantic judgment that cannot be verified by file reads alone — operator judgment needed\n\n### Note on Agent Failure\n\nAgent pp3g-Jo2n could not post this verdict due to the same auditor-sandbox restriction documented in #355/#398: the auditor role's permission surface blocks session start, comment posting, and .kickoff-status writes. This is the 5th instance of this failure class observed today.","created_at":"2026-08-18T08:06:17.193829128Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:FOc8iHLYN/NSoSugkswPiYPxvLKGX055ikWItGno4sw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpv9fo06Wf83NELk3AP/D/5T97brh1vD8eFCXUaPZ168AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABABs1wXMrEW2irHf40YsH4LjJC+fQkD9WyOnDW7UGe6Spmjuh/M/BEGb84XwmGsoTAfzG+NI7IgWGHJUTDmfJ2Dg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:FOc8iHLYN/NSoSugkswPiYPxvLKGX055ikWItGno4sw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpv9fo06Wf83NELk3AP/D/5T97brh1vD8eFCXUaPZ168AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGxKk61zEaS7dIWIVqfa2HqOlWDJRqmwC/Wggbxnu6Ix99yqRxIAmGmp/lBVviSTvFbtJ4pQuwylSWUDwt/4xwM="}
{"agent_id":"pp3g-sQsC-recovery-issue-406-five-mimo-auditor-agents-completed","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-18T08:07:38.870068115Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"a494de5a-1e07-4115-9286-ec2a22a58619","comment_uuid":"0a8ffeb5-8fb0-4c08-8334-2d6cd8415ece","author":"pp3g-sQsC-recovery-issue-406-five-mimo-auditor-agents-completed","content":"## 5-Instance Confirmation of Auditor Verdict-Loss Failure Class (2026-08-18)\n\nToday's five mimo auditor agents (pp3g-hngZ, pp3g-HdGN, pp3g-pCVo, pp3g-Jo2n, pp3g-zpjP) all hit the same finalization barrier. The auditor role's sandbox blocks:\n1. **** — cannot write the DONE marker\n2. **** — cannot manage session lifecycle\n3. **Result comment posting** — in some cases, the agent couldn't post its  comment\n\n### Instance Summary\n\n| Agent | Issue | Audit Target | Verdict | Finalization |\n|-------|-------|-------------|---------|-------------|\n| pp3g-hngZ | #394 | Hook research #388/#389 | CONDITIONAL PASS (4 preconditions) | Could not write DONE; result comment recovered by orchestrator |\n| pp3g-HdGN | #402 | Failure matrix | CONDITIONAL PASS (6 preconditions) | Could not write DONE; result comment was posted via crosslink |\n| pp3g-pCVo | #403 | Playbook §7.2 | CONDITIONAL PASS (2 preconditions) | Could not write DONE; result comment was posted via crosslink |\n| pp3g-Jo2n | #404 | Hook inventory #391 | CONDITIONAL PASS (reconstructed) | Could NOT post result comment — verdict lost, reconstructed from tmux pane by orchestrator |\n| pp3g-zpjP | #405 | Model-discipline standing facts | CONDITIONAL PASS (all OK, 1 systemic note) | Could not write DONE; result comment was posted via crosslink |\n\n### Failure Pattern\n\n- **4 of 5** agents posted their verdicts via  (the one allowed bash command) but could not write  DONE\n- **1 of 5** (pp3g-Jo2n) could not even start a session or post comments — the sandbox blocked Session #1 is already active (started 2026-08-18 08:02) AND  for this agent\n- The pp3g-Jo2n verdict had to be **reconstructed from the tmux pane** by the recovery agent (#406)\n\n### Occurrence Count\n\nThis is the **3rd+ occurrence** of this failure class:\n- **1st**: #355 original (2026-08-10, 2 instances: pp3g-TOx4 on #344, pp3g-mdQf on #350)\n- **2nd**: #398 (2026-08-18, 4 instances: #391, #392, #393, #397)\n- **3rd**: #406 (2026-08-18, 5 instances: #394, #402, #403, #404, #405)\n\n**Total confirmed instances: 11 auditors across 3 batches affected by the same root cause.**\n\n### Root Cause (confirmed by #398)\n\nThe auditor role's permission surface (orchestrator-guard plugin + crosslink-guard bash allowlist) blocks:\n- File writes (, , )\n- Session lifecycle commands ()\n- In some configurations, even  (pp3g-Jo2n's case)\n\nThis is the mechanical root cause: the read-only role design correctly prevents code modification but inadvertently prevents the finalization step that makes the audit consumable.\n\n### Related\n- #398 (finalization gap investigation — confirmed mechanical root cause)\n- #357 (auditor tool-surface gaps — the permission surface that causes this)\n- #330 (checkpointing-as-durability)","created_at":"2026-08-18T08:07:38.862156916Z","kind":"observation","signed_by":"SHA256:FOc8iHLYN/NSoSugkswPiYPxvLKGX055ikWItGno4sw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpv9fo06Wf83NELk3AP/D/5T97brh1vD8eFCXUaPZ168AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAz+ixyO5qn5WeUd2jQb1jREngQA2b1btihS4crqvACGb3KzpVLmw20bpNN2mJwduTfIhlW83piJV800OdXgebAg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:FOc8iHLYN/NSoSugkswPiYPxvLKGX055ikWItGno4sw","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgpv9fo06Wf83NELk3AP/D/5T97brh1vD8eFCXUaPZ168AAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAfAJ7Fc8hk7wpIpTrXhqgIYFi67E8/4cErdzx6M8yJVzrIF2ISg+VS36tbuo329nRZi16y0WYyNJZNqq6UnQgg="}
